   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: three knobs on top of the B7 order",
   "originalText": "How it works: three knobs on top of the B7 order",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a16-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 782,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Knob                       YAML                         Values                       RFC 7916\n-------------------------  ---------------------------  ---------------------------  --------\nNode-protecting (Ineq. 3)  lfa_policy.node_protecting   prefer · require · ignore    §6.2.2\nDownstream (Ineq. 2)       lfa_policy.downstream        prefer · require · ignore    §6.2.3\nExclude a neighbor         lfa_exclude: [B] on S        router ids                   §6.2.4.4\n\nprefer is the default. The two preferences are per network; the exclude list is per router.",
   "originalText": "Knob                       YAML                         Values                       RFC 7916\n-------------------------  ---------------------------  ---------------------------  --------\nNode-protecting (Ineq. 3)  lfa_policy.node_protecting   prefer · require · ignore    §6.2.2\nDownstream (Ineq. 2)       lfa_policy.downstream        prefer · require · ignore    §6.2.3\nExclude a neighbor         lfa_exclude: [B] on S        router ids                   §6.2.4.4\n\nprefer is the default. The two preferences are per network; the exclude list is per router.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a16-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 299,
   "width": 953,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  exclude: S’s links to that neighbor are skipped before any check (reason excluded), like a\n   max-metric link (B6).\n•  require: a loop-free neighbor that fails the inequality is shown with its numbers, marked\n   policyRejected, never chosen.\n•  ignore: that step of the order is skipped; the rest keep their order.\n•  prefer: the default order (B7): node-protecting → downstream → lowest cost → router ID → link id.",
   "originalText": "•  exclude: S’s links to that neighbor are skipped before any check (reason excluded), like a\n   max-metric link (B6).\n•  require: a loop-free neighbor that fails the inequality is shown with its numbers, marked\n   policyRejected, never chosen.\n•  ignore: that step of the order is skipped; the rest keep their order.\n•  prefer: the default order (B7): node-protecting → downstream → lowest cost → router ID → link id.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a16-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 437,
   "width": 298,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The two candidates for S → D",
   "originalText": "The two candidates for S → D",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a16-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 471,
   "width": 783,
   "height": 75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "N  dist(N,D)  Loop-free        Downstream (< 11)  Node-protecting          Cost\n-  ---------  ---------------  -----------------  -----------------------  ------------\nA  2 (A-E-D)  2 < 10+11  ✓     2 < 11  ✓          2 < 1+1  ✗  (via E)      10 + 2 = 12\nB  11 (B-D)   11 < 2+11  ✓     11 < 11 ✗          11 < 12+1  ✓             2 + 11 = 13",
   "originalText": "N  dist(N,D)  Loop-free        Downstream (< 11)  Node-protecting          Cost\n-  ---------  ---------------  -----------------  -----------------------  ------------\nA  2 (A-E-D)  2 < 10+11  ✓     2 < 11  ✓          2 < 1+1  ✗  (via E)      10 + 2 = 12\nB  11 (B-D)   11 < 2+11  ✓     11 < 11 ✗          11 < 12+1  ✓             2 + 11 = 13",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a16-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 556,
   "width": 923,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If require leaves no LFA, the destination has no LFA, so Remote LFA is used (B13). Here: PQ node A, the\ncheapest (dist(S,A) = 10).",
   "originalText": "If require leaves no LFA, the destination has no LFA, so Remote LFA is used (B13). Here: PQ node A, the\ncheapest (dist(S,A) = 10).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
